<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - May 13.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - May 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to London Jun 113.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to East Anglia harvest 93.50 Oct/Dec 98.50</p>
<p>Liverpool May 95.00 Jun 96.00</p>
<p>Hereford Jul 96.50/96.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire May 93.00/92.50 Jun 94.50/94.00/93.50 Jul 96.00/95.50</p>
<p>South Humberside May 92.50/92.00 Jun 94.00/93.50 Jul 96.00/96.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Jun 94.50/93.50 Jul 96.00/95.50</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Jun 94.00</p>
<p>Staffordshire Jul 96.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jul 95.00</p>
<p>Suffolk/Essex asa 94.25/94.00 Oct/Dec 99.50/98.75</p>
<p>Avon Jun 94.00/93.50 Jul 96.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to south Humberside May 94.00</p>
<p>Avon four Jun 94.00</p>
</text>
